=== lcd-osd1ctl-directfb-watch.sh (mode: stock-config) ===
Restoring stock's exact real config: QWS_DISPLAY without 'systemonly', and directfbrc's no-layers-clear/no-surface-clear re-enabled (both of those are our own theory-driven divergences from stock, not things stock itself needs).
Baseline (before starting DirectFB):
  OSD1_CTL=0x001660FF (format=6 rgb_order=5(stock-encoding) yuv_order=0)
  CONTROL=0x03740081 (OSD1_enabled=1)
  OSD1_ADDR=0x0F000000

Starting start_msn_directfb -- watch the screen, Ctrl-C when done (black screen or not)...
